# Smartsupp

> Smartsupp is a conversational commerce platform that provides live chat, chatbots, and an AI shopping assistant to help businesses communicate with their website visitors and customers. It is trusted by e-commerce businesses to increase sales and improve customer support through real-time engagement and automated tools.

## Key Features

- [Live Chat](/live-chat/): Real-time communication with website visitors via a customizable chat widget.
- [Chatbots](/chatbot/): Automated chatbots for lead generation, answering FAQs, and guiding visitors.
- [Lead Generation Chatbot](/lead-generation-chatbot/): Specialized chatbots designed to automatically gather leads.
- [Multichannel Customer Service](/multichannel-customer-service-engagement/): Engage with customers across multiple platforms from a single dashboard.
- [Mira AI Shopping Assistant](/mira-ai-shopping-assistant/): An advanced AI tool that recommends products and answers up to 80% of customer queries.
- Visitor Recording: Visual recordings of visitor activity to understand their behavior on your website.

